         reset settles back to this clearance.  Noise-free, the statue settles 0.134 deg nose-down and 0.13 mm
         higher (the digits sink deeper than the pads), and 0.115 deg over 40 seeds at reset noise 0.05: that is
         natural_pitch (0.002 rad), measured on the pelvis frame the posture reward reads; the joints settle within
         0.003 deg of the keyframe (note 14c).
